死馬之骨，亦以郭隗之故。」弁不能答。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":11,"end":14,"surface":"毛惠秀","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0011","person_id":"vao_luy_v0w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作毛。"},{"start":21,"end":22,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0021","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":63,"end":64,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0063","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":77,"end":78,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0077","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":89,"end":92,"surface":"房景高","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0089","person_id":"cua_mzu_j40","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作房。"},{"start":93,"end":95,"surface":"宋弁","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0093","person_id":"sra_l7p_eeg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作宋。"},{"start":96,"end":97,"surface":"弁","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0096","person_id":"sra_l7p_eeg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作宋。"},{"start":98,"end":99,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0098","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":111,"end":112,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0111","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":126,"end":128,"surface":"景高","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0126","person_id":"cua_mzu_j40","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本